.TH VLEN 1.SH NAMEvlen \- variable-length record demonstration.SH SYNOPSIS\fBvlen\fR.SH DESCRIPTION\fBvlen\fRdemonstrates Jon Simkins's variable-length record store.  It creates astore of its own in the current directory -- the files\fBtest.mp\fR(the mapper) and\fBtest.st\fR(the store) -- adds a hundred records of varying length, and prints eachas it goes with the minimum and maximum record lengths and the state ofthe mapper.  It ignores any arguments..PPRun it twice and the second run answers\fBFilesystem already exists.\fRand adds nothing: remove the two files to start again..SH NOTESNeeds Microware's\fBcio\fR.\fR